# Author: Oleksii Hnidan
# Project: web-security26 | Lab: 4 | File: csrf-audit.http
# Run from top to bottom. CSRF is disabled for this stateless API.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tracks

### 1. Show all tracks - expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 2. Read one track - expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create one track - expected 201, createdBy admin
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Be Quiet and Drive (Far Away)",
  "artist": "Deftones",
  "album": "Around the Fur",
  "durationSeconds": 300
}

### 4. Update track 4 - expected 200, version 2
PUT {{baseUrl}}/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Be Quiet and Drive (Far Away)",
  "artist": "Deftones",
  "album": "Around the Fur",
  "durationSeconds": 301
}

### 5. Delete track 4 - expected 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
